WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.622 --> 00:00:15.383
night the group held a feast.

2
00:00:17.685 --> 00:00:19.365
Everyone had a bowl of porridge.

3
00:00:20.586 --> 00:00:23.268
Small dishes of vegetables sat on the table too.

4
00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:29.811
to our group of bandits!"

5
00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:30.932
Mok said.

6
00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.582
The thieves cheered, then everyone started to eat.

7
00:00:39.785 --> 00:00:41.306
Gildong looked at his bowl.

8
00:00:43.027 --> 00:00:44.568
There was so little porridge.

9
00:00:44.588 --> 00:00:47.631
"Is this really a feast?"

10
00:00:47.951 --> 00:00:48.831
Gildong said.

11
00:00:50.012 --> 00:00:50.873
Nabi nodded.

12
00:00:50.893 --> 00:00:52.714
"Of course it is.

13
00:00:53.795 --> 00:00:55.996
This is more porridge than we normally eat.

14
00:00:58.118 --> 00:00:59.859
And we have vegetables today."

15
00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:02.628
She giggled.

16
00:01:02.648 --> 00:01:05.569
"You've got a lot to learn, little lord."

17
00:01:05.589 --> 00:01:09.290
"I told you, I'm not a lord.

18
00:01:10.111 --> 00:01:13.171
I'm a commoner, just like you," Gildong said.

19
00:01:13.191 --> 00:01:17.693
"You grew up in a noble's house," Nabi said.

20
00:01:17.713 --> 00:01:20.174
"So, you're not just like us.

21
00:01:21.254 --> 00:01:22.834
This is how common people eat."

22
00:01:25.795 --> 00:01:27.936
"Oh," Gildong said softly.

23
00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:33.885
"We've got twenty sacks of rice," Mok said.

24
00:01:33.905 --> 00:01:37.026
"But we need to save them so we don't run out."

25
00:01:37.046 --> 00:01:38.886
"You're thieves.

26
00:01:39.326 --> 00:01:40.587
Can't you just steal more?"

27
00:01:40.927 --> 00:01:41.867
Gildong asked.

28
00:01:43.508 --> 00:01:46.948
"Most people don't have much food," Nabi said.

29
00:01:46.968 --> 00:01:52.450
"And lots of bad officials charge high taxes," Mok said.

30
00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:56.111
"They take grain from the poor and keep it for themselves."

31
00:01:57.932 --> 00:01:59.052
"Officials do that?"

32
00:01:59.884 --> 00:02:02.406
Gildong felt upset by what he was learning.

33
00:02:04.087 --> 00:02:08.110
Greedy officials had more than they needed while people went hungry.

34
00:02:09.411 --> 00:02:10.171
Mok nodded.

35
00:02:10.191 --> 00:02:13.714
"In fact, I heard about a temple in Hapcheon.

36
00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:18.277
The greedy monks there have a storehouse filled with grain and treasure.

37
00:02:18.977 --> 00:02:22.860
It's huge—I wish we could rob it!"

38
00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:24.901
"Why can't you?"

39
00:02:25.181 --> 00:02:26.122
Gildong asked.

40
00:02:26.142 --> 00:02:29.748
"It's impossible to rob," Mok said.

41
00:02:29.768 --> 00:02:32.329
"There are too many monks there."

42
00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:36.490
"Hmm." Gildong thought for a moment.

43
00:02:37.611 --> 00:02:40.232
He wanted to learn more about these greedy monks.

44
00:02:41.472 --> 00:02:42.772
An idea came to him.

45
00:02:42.792 --> 00:02:54.116
"I'll visit that Gildong waited at the temple gate with a few followers.

46
00:02:57.108 --> 00:02:59.390
The head monk rushed out and bowed.

47
00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:06.174
"I'm sorry to keep you waiting, young master."

48
00:03:07.275 --> 00:03:09.036
He took a good look at Gildong.

49
00:03:11.378 --> 00:03:13.819
"We are honored by your visit.

50
00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:16.901
What brings you here?"

51
00:03:16.921 --> 00:03:22.145
"I am preparing for the royal examinations," Gildong said.

52
00:03:22.165 --> 00:03:24.947
"I have heard good things about your temple.

53
00:03:25.907 --> 00:03:26.948
I wish to study here."

54
00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.342
The head monk nodded eagerly.

55
00:03:30.362 --> 00:03:33.685
"Certainly, young master.

56
00:03:34.666 --> 00:03:37.768
Please be our honored guest.

57
00:03:38.529 --> 00:03:42.893
Though, we must humbly ask for a donation."

58
00:03:42.913 --> 00:03:47.477
"I will send twenty sacks of rice soon," Gildong said.

59
00:03:49.419 --> 00:03:50.840
The monk's eyes lit up.

60
00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:54.824
"That's very generous of you."

61
00:03:56.652 --> 00:03:58.515
"Prepare a feast for my return in a week.

62
00:03:59.416 --> 00:04:01.779
All the monks must attend," Gildong said.

63
00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:04.662
The monk bowed deeply.

64
00:04:04.682 --> 00:04:08.787
"As you wish, young master."
